{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u8700\u6c49\u518d\u4e34\uff1a\u6e90\u8d77 Restart ShuHan Dynasty:Origin",
    "steam_appid": 3371480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the brink of destiny\u2019s collapse, you open your eyes to a world engulfed in flames\u2014a world of unyielding loyalty, burning passion, and ceaseless strife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic era, you, a modern soul, believe you hold the advantage, knowing the path ahead. Yet as you delve deeper, those familiar yet foreign faces, those inescapable choices, begin to quietly unravel everything you thought was unshakable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Restart ShuHan Dynasty:Origin</i> is an interactive movie game centered around profound narrative branching and immersive storytelling. You will step into the turmoil of the Three Kingdoms as Liu Bei himself, rewriting every battle, every encounter, every twist of fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every path hides consequences. Every trust demands a price. And every choice is a battle against destiny itself. Between the flames of war and the sting of betrayal, between loyalty and ambition\u2014your greatest adversary may not be your enemies, but the hidden threads of your own fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You believe you are saving everything. Yet what awaits your return\u2026 is another version of yourself. When the truth surfaces, will you have the courage to face those eyes\u2014so familiar, yet so unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories are being torn apart, destinies are overlapping\u2014<strong>who are you, truly?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Restart ShuHan Dynasty:Origin</i>: This time, history is not written by heaven\u2019s will.\u00a0<strong>It is yours to command.</strong> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the brink of destiny\u2019s collapse, you open your eyes to a world engulfed in flames\u2014a world of unyielding loyalty, burning passion, and ceaseless strife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic era, you, a modern soul, believe you hold the advantage, knowing the path ahead. Yet as you delve deeper, those familiar yet foreign faces, those inescapable choices, begin to quietly unravel everything you thought was unshakable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Restart ShuHan Dynasty:Origin</i> is an interactive movie game centered around profound narrative branching and immersive storytelling. You will step into the turmoil of the Three Kingdoms as Liu Bei himself, rewriting every battle, every encounter, every twist of fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every path hides consequences. Every trust demands a price. And every choice is a battle against destiny itself. Between the flames of war and the sting of betrayal, between loyalty and ambition\u2014your greatest adversary may not be your enemies, but the hidden threads of your own fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You believe you are saving everything. Yet what awaits your return\u2026 is another version of yourself. When the truth surfaces, will you have the courage to face those eyes\u2014so familiar, yet so unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories are being torn apart, destinies are overlapping\u2014<strong>who are you, truly?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Restart ShuHan Dynasty:Origin</i>: This time, history is not written by heaven\u2019s will.\u00a0<strong>It is yours to command.</strong> </p>",
    "short_description": "In the first Three Kingdoms-themed interactive movie game \u2018Restart ShuHan Dynasty:Origin\u2019, you take a role of an unlucky worker who time-travels to the late Eastern Han Dynasty. Faced with intricate storylines and the merciless twists of fate, you will personally experience a unique tale.",
